1c:["$","p","1",{"children":["Every year, campus recruiters review thousands of Computer Science resumes containing identical project titles: *'Student Management System'*, *'Library Book Tracker'*, or *'Online Bookstore'*. While these demonstrate foundational familiarity with controllers and repositories, they fail to answer the primary question technical interviewers care about:"]}]
